---
description: The scheduling engine is pure and has nine proven invariants.
globs: packages/scheduling-core/**
alwaysApply: false
---

Before changing anything here, read `.claude/skills/scheduling-invariants/SKILL.md`
and follow it exactly.

- Nine properties must hold, verified by fast-check at 1,000+ runs each.
- Zero dependencies. `package.json` `dependencies` must stay `{}`.
- No `async`, no `Promise`, no `Math.random`, no `Date.now`, no clock time at all.
  `pnpm lint` runs `scripts/check-purity.mjs`, which fails the build on any of
  these.
- Add the property test first and watch it fail. Then implement.
- Re-run `pnpm bench` after any engine change; p95 must stay under 50 ms.
